# 03_deep_relaxation_RGB.ledc — Deep Relaxation / Stress Melt, RGB inner/outer build
# RGB variant of 03_deep_relaxation. Audio + speech IDENTICAL; LEDs on inner ring
# (mask 9) + outer ring (mask 6), 180 antiphase with a SINE gate while flickering.
# The entrainment beat is AUDIO isochronic; the LED is a dim cool->warm wash: it stays
# STEADY (freq 0) during the 14 Hz portion (safety — adjacent to the 15-25 Hz band),
# then flickers only once the beat is <=10 Hz. Colour glides cool blue -> warm amber
# across the theta hold. Brightness capped 30%. See base header for safety.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask [env phase]

# --- Induction: beat 14 Hz (audio only); LED STEADY + dim; cool blue ---
0 0 50 >0 0 80 180 9 1 0          # inner: steady (freq 0), bright 0->30 over 15 s, cool blue
0 0 50 >0 0 80 180 6 1 180        # outer: steady, cool blue
A 0 200 0 >0 14 1 0 0             # ch1 carrier 200, isochronic mod 14 Hz; vol 0->55; sine
S 3000 default 10 "Beginning at fourteen hertz. Let the tension of the day begin to loosen."
15000 0 50 30 0 80 180 9 1 0      # inner: bright 30% hold, still steady (no flicker at 14 Hz)
15000 0 50 30 0 80 180 6 1 180    # outer
A 45000 200 0 55 >14 1 0 0        # vol 55; isochronic mod ramps 14->10 across induction

# --- Alpha reached: LED flicker safely begins at 10 Hz, glides to 6 with the beat ---
300000 >10 50 30 0 80 180 9 1 0   # inner: flicker 10->6 (1:1 beat), dim blue
300000 >10 50 30 0 80 180 6 1 180 # outer: antiphase
A 300000 200 0 55 >10 1 0 0       # isochronic mod 10->6 Hz (deepening toward theta)
S 300000 default 10 "You have reached alpha, ten hertz. Descending gently now toward theta."

# --- Theta core: hold 6 Hz; cool blue -> warm amber colour shift ---
720000 6 50 30 >0 >80 >180 9 1 0   # inner: 6 Hz hold; RGB glides blue(0,80,180)->amber(255,140,30)
720000 6 50 30 >0 >80 >180 6 1 180 # outer: same glide, antiphase
A 720000 200 0 55 6 1 0 0          # isochronic mod 6 Hz — 12 min theta dwell
S 720000 default 10 "Resting in theta now, six hertz. Let everything melt away."

# --- Exit: beat 6 -> 10 Hz (calm-alert alpha), amber ---
1440000 >6 50 30 255 140 30 9 1 0   # inner: flicker 6->10; amber held
1440000 >6 50 30 255 140 30 6 1 180 # outer
A 1440000 200 0 55 >6 1 0 0         # isochronic mod 6->10 Hz (exit to alpha, NOT beta)
S 1440000 default 10 "Slowly rising now, coming back up toward calm, alert alpha."
1620000 10 50 28 255 160 60 9 1 0   # inner: 10 Hz hold; warm amber; bright 28%
1620000 10 50 28 255 160 60 6 1 180 # outer
A 1620000 200 0 55 10 1 0 0         # isochronic mod 10 Hz held
S 1620000 default 10 "Back at ten hertz, relaxed and clear. Gently return to the room."

# --- Gentle close: brightness + volume fade to 0 over the final 30 s ---
1770000 10 50 >28 255 160 60 9 1 0   # inner: bright 28->0; flicker stays 10 Hz (never abrupt)
1770000 10 50 >28 255 160 60 6 1 180 # outer
A 1770000 200 0 >55 10 1 0 0         # volume 55->0; beat held at alpha 10 Hz
1800000 10 50 0 255 160 60 9 1 0     # inner: bright 0
1800000 10 50 0 255 160 60 6 1 180   # outer
A 1800000 200 0 0 10 1 0 0           # volume 0

S 1800000 default 20 "WAKE UP!"
S 1810000 default 40 "WAKE UP!"
S 1820000 default 50 "WAKE UP!"
S 1830000 default 60 "WAKE UP!"
